cascade level2 vertical"></span> <span class="cascade level2 horizontal"></span> Mitglieder-Anmeldung </a> </li>  </ul> </li>       <li> <a href="javascript:void(0);">  <span class="cascade level1 vertical"></span> <span class="cascade level1 horizontal"></span> <span class="subcategory-title">Mitglieder-Website</span> </a> </li>    <li> <ul class="grandchildren-menu">         <li> <a href="https://www.airchina.de:443/CAPortal/dyn/portal/DisplayPage?LANGUAGE=DE&amp;COUNTRY_SITE=DE&amp;SITE=B000CA00&amp;PAGE=FFPJ" target='_blank'> <span class="cascade level2 vertical"></span> <span class="cascade level2 horizontal"></span> Mitglieder-Website </a> </li>  </ul> </li>     </ul>  </li>  </ul>   </div> </div> </div> <section class="ca-r-header-fix hidden-md hidden-lg"></section>              <div id="guardian-verification-popin" class="modal gcpmodal guardian-verification-popin" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-describedby="formPromptBody"> <div class="gcpmodal-content"> <div class="loginShim ca-r-loginShim gcp-loginshim" id="gcp-loginshim"> <div class="aligner"> <span class="aligner-helper"> </span> <img src="/go/img/login-ajax-loader.gif" alt="Lädt
"> </div> </div> <span class="gcpclose"> <button type="button" class="ca-r-button-close close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"> <span class="ca-icon-popin-cross"> <span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span> </span> </button> </span> <div class="guardian-error-msg"> <div class="gcp_error_icon_div"> <span class="gcp_error_circle"> <span class="gcp_error_icon"> </span> </span> </div> <div class="gcp_error_span_div"></div> <br> </div> <div class="ca-v2-header" tabindex="0"> <h3 class="ca-v2-header_text header-text" tabindex="0">Vormundsüberprüfung</h3> </div> <div class="ca-v2-body gcpbody" tabindex="0"> <div class="gcpnotice_div"> <div id="GUARDIAN_VERIFICATION_NOTICE" class="dwm-content">1.Sie versuchen, sich bei einem Konto eines Minderjährigen anzumelden. Sie müssen die Erlaubnis eines Vormundes erhalten, oder ein Vormund muss diese Handlung ausführen.<br>2.Bitte geben Sie oben die Mitgliedskartennummer und das Passwort des Vormundes ein, um die Identität des Vormundes zu bestätigen.</div> </div> <br> <form class="form-horizontal gcpform" action="/CAPortal/dyn/portal/ffp/" method="post" id="guardianLoginPanel">  <input type="hidden" name="COUNTRY_SITE" value="DE" /> <input type="hidden" name="SITE" value="B000CA00" /> <input type="hidden" name="LANGUAGE" value="DE" /> <input type="hidden" name="captchaTime" value="2026-11-05 18:11:47.04" /> <div class="form-group"> <label class="gcplabel control-label col-sm-2" for="guardianLoginId">Mitgliedskarten-Nummer des Vormunds<span class="gcprequired-mark">*</span></label> <input type="text" class="gcpinput form-control" id="guardianLoginId" placeholder="Mit Kartennummer der PhoenixMiles Card anmelden" name="guardianLoginId" required> </div> <div class="form-group"> <label class="gcplabel control-label col-sm-2" for="guardianPwd">Passwort der Mitgliedskarte des Vormunds<span class="gcprequired-mark">*</span></label> <input type="password" class="gcpinput form-control" id="guardianPwd" placeholder="Passwort" name="guardianLoginPassword" required> </div> <div class="form-group gcpbutton-form-group"> <div class="gcpbuttondiv"> <button id="confirmGuardian" class="gcpbutton btn ca-r-btn-quick btn-sm ca-r-btn-primary ca-r-btn-color-secondary-empty-quick" type="button">Überprüfung</button> </div> </div> </form> </div> </div> </div>              <div id="cookie-notice-popin" class="modal cnpmodal cookie-notice-popin" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-describedby="formPromptBody"> <div class="cnpmodal-content"> <span class="cnpclose"> <button type="button" class="ca-r-button-close close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"> <span class="ca-icon-popin-cross"> <span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span> </span> </button> </span> <div class="ca-v2-header" tabindex="0"> <h3 class="ca-v2-header_text header-text" tabindex="0">Cookie-Einstellungen</h3> </div> <div class="ca-v2-body cnpbody" tabindex="0"> <br> <form class="form-horizontal cnpform" action="/CAPortal/dyn/portal/ffp/" method="post" id="cookieNoticePref">  <input type="hidden" name="captchaTime" value="2026-11-05 18:11:47.04"/> <label class="cnplabel control-label col-sm-2" >Cookie-Einstellungen</label> <div class="form-group-cookie ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_selector"> <div class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_parent"> <div tabindex="0" class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type button active" data-type="A" id="allCookieButton"> <span class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_text"> ALLE ZULASSEN</span> </div> </div> <div class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_parent"> <div tabindex="0" class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type button" data-type="D" id="denyCookieButton"> <span class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_text"> ALLE ABLEHNEN</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class="form-group-cookie"> <div class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle" tabindex="0"> <label class="switch"> <input type="checkbox" checked value="1" readonly="readonly" class="cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_necessary" id="necessaryCookies"> <span class="slider round"></span> </label> <span class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_text" >Essenzielle Website-Cookies</span> </div> <div class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_content" tabindex="0"> <span class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_content_text">Diese Cookies sind unbedingt notwendig, um Ihnen die Dienste bereitzustellen, die über unsere Websites verfügbar sind und um einige ihrer Funktionen zu nutzen, wie z. B. den Zugang zu sicheren Bereichen.</span> </div> </div> <div class="form-group-cookie"> <div class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle" tabindex="0"> <label class="switch"> <input type="checkbox" checked value="1" class="cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_analytical" id="analyticalCookies"> <span class="slider round"></span> </label> <span class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_text">Analyse- und Individualisierungscookies</span> </div> <div class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_content" tabindex="0"> <span class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_content_text"><p>Diese Cookies sammeln Informationen, die entweder in zusammengefasster Form verwendet werden, damit wir besser verstehen können, wie unsere Websites genutzt werden oder wie effektiv unsere Marketingkampagnen sind oder damit wir unsere Websites besser für Sie anpassen können.</p></span> </div> </div> <div class="form-group-cookie"> <div class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle" tabindex="0"> <label class="switch"> <input type="checkbox" checked value="1" class="cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_marketing" id="marketingCookies"> <span class="slider round"></span> </label> <span class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_text">Cookies für soziale Netzwerke</span> </div> <div class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_content" tabindex="0"> <span class="ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_preference_type_toggle_content_text">Diese Cookies werden verwendet, damit Sie Seiten und Inhalte, die Sie auf unseren Websites für relevant erachten, über soziale Netzwerke und andere Websites von Drittanbietern teilen können. Diese Cookies können auch zu Werbezwecken verwendet werden.</span> </div> </div> <div class="form-group-cookie ca-v2-fsf_cookie_notice_note" tabindex="0"> <span class="cookie_notice_note_head"> Zur Erinnerung：</span> <span class="cookie_notice_note_content"> Sie können jederzeit unter "Datenschutzerklärung" Ihre Cookie-Einstellungen ändern.</span> </div> <div class="form-group-cookie cnpbutton-form-group-cookie" > <div class="cnpbuttondiv" tabindex="0"> <button id="saveSelection" class="cnpbutton btn ca-r-btn-quick btn-sm ca-r-btn-primary ca-r-btn-color-secondary-empty-quick" type="button">Speichern</button> </div> </div> </form> </div> </div> </div>                 </div> <div class="hidden-xs hidden-sm">                 <div class="top-nav-wrapper"> <nav class="main-menu" aria-label="Hauptmenü">                    <div class="menu menu-action-options pull-left" style="font-size: 0" role="menu">            <span aria-hidden="true" class="sprite slantedSeparator invisible edge">&nbsp;</span><a id="menuLink1" role="menuitem" aria-label="Home" class="homeIconLink" href="https://www.airchina.de:443/CAPortal/dyn/portal/DisplayPage?LANGUAGE=DE&amp;COUNTRY_SITE=DE&amp;SITE=B000CA00&amp;PAGE=HOME"><span class="sprite arrow-up" aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;</span></a>                <span aria-hidden="true" class="sprite slantedSeparator">&nbsp;</span> <a role="menuitem" aria-haspopup="true" id="menuLink2" class="type-2" href="https://www.airchina.de/DE/DE/booking/" data-child-target="bookingMenuItem" ><span>Buchungsverwaltung</span><span class="sr-only"> Klicken Sie den “Pfeil nach unten” um das Untermenü aufzurufen</span></a>                 <span aria-hidden="true" class="sprite slantedSeparator">&n